# LF everywhere, also on Windows: local release builds must be byte-identical to the Linux
# builds of GitHub Actions and F-Droid (reproducible builds). Only Windows scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.jks binary
